        "How do you feel physically and mentally when you're in a space that doesn't feel like your own workspace?",
        "Are there any specific tasks or situations at work that make you feel more anxious or stressed than others?",
        "Can you think of a recent time when the work environment was particularly challenging for you? What happened, and how did you cope?",
        "How do you usually handle it when your schedule changes unexpectedly, and what's the impact on your overall well-being?",
        "Is there anything in particular that makes you feel more productive or focused at work, and can you replicate those conditions elsewhere?",
        "Have you noticed any patterns in how your body responds to different work environments over time? For example, do you tend to feel more energized or fatigued in certain spaces?"
    ]
}
